<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>Include &lt;<link linkend="_std__based__type_8hpp">glm/gtx/std_based_type.hpp</link>&gt; to use the features of this extension.</para>

<para>Adds vector types based on STL value types.</para>
</section>
